    "body": "Implementation plan (base b1411ab1): extend the existing StockEnv / Exit::Feed pattern from #278 to multi-pass, chamfer and taper. Expected source scope: operation/turning_stock.rs, generation dispatch, and motion turning/contour. Regression scope: a longer-bar test per kind, stock-contained windows, same-end/no-stock controls, plus an intentionally rapid exit rejected by the existing verifier/post gate. Keep silhouette promises, geometry, feeds and collision/post gates unchanged. Native Windows bounded verification and independent review run in separate pinned support worktrees; one shared Cargo target owner. No new dependencies/schema/technology. Reproduction will determine whether P0 escalation is warranted; no silent-safety-failure claim yet.",
